Subject: Custom Distribution with double indexing
Message-ID: <UZs8P7_fmw4.8SSlgpFKt2sJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/UZs8P7_fmw4/m/8SSlgpFKt2sJ>
