[1] 1 0
which is an edge-case that apparently isn't supported because it can't roundtrip it to the unconstrained space and back. If you are going to initialize the parameters, you should initialize them to interior values. But in most cases, you only need to initialize the parameters yourself if you observe problems due to Stan's initial values, and even in that case the first thing to do would be to set init_r to a value less than 2.

