Subject: Re: [stan-users] Model consultation: Vector Autoregression (VAR) in Stan
Message-ID: <8RerHVzxjUQ.LYEHjstLGVkJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <8RerHVzxjUQ.PfBFU8DG4xAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
