Subject: WAIC and hierarchies
Message-ID: <XPaii4BCzF0.QZz_tkegGakJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/XPaii4BCzF0/m/QZz_tkegGakJ>
