> I believe I do need y to be a matrix so I can eventually do the loop over M datasets. Unless you can suggest another workaround where I can declare N as a vector of length y and then parse out the M datasets later in the code...?

I agree.

matrix[4,3] y;

would give you a 4 x 3 matrix,

matrix[4,{1,2,3}] y;

would give you a syntax error about how the parser was looking for an integer but got an array of integers instead.

