Subject: How to specify monotone parameters?
Message-ID: <d5Ui1lvWg5w.MhDgkCWP0a0J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/d5Ui1lvWg5w/m/MhDgkCWP0a0J>
