Subject: Re: HMM and ARCH(1) model
Message-ID: <NpYymWBQTi4.K9Zuc33hkQIJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <NpYymWBQTi4.6vrxC-HzSw0J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
