On Friday, July 24, 2015 at 9:44:18 AM UTC-4, Tamas Papp wrote:
> My understanding is that Stan can't just grab expm from an
> existing library, because it also need the Jacobian --- is this
> correct, or are there other obstacles/requirements (licensing
> etc)?

Mostly the Jacobian. Eigen has the previous generation of Higham's algorithm in unsupported/matrix_functions but we can't autodiff it

Ben

