What I had that almost worked would be considered a less good approach to calculating the matrix exponential than that in Eigen/unsupported. Although we could autodiff it, whereas the pretty good implementation in Eigen/unsupported only takes Eigen::MatrixXd. If we could work out that Jacobian for that it would be better. There are some papers out there on this but no code that I know of.

Ben

