Subject: Re: physics problem! Re: [stan-users] Two-dim "Mixture-model" with Log-normal distributed data and normal uncertainty
Message-ID: <YPLfYWMGVyk.0fNCospH-VwJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <YPLfYWMGVyk.kK27MX10ACcJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
